WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.955 --> 00:00:08.031
Well, I clearly got the answer wrong
being that I was rejected twice.

00:00:08.031 --> 00:00:12.510
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Seems to have worked out for you.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:16.391
[LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Let me start with that, so

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:22.806
look you're all young, you want to achieve
and you're in that first third part,

00:00:22.806 --> 00:00:28.680
I describe my life in this these three
thirds, you're in the first part.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:34.727
But if I would give you some advice and
I'm going to take some poetic license,

00:00:34.727 --> 00:00:36.714
I'm not going to say one thing.

00:00:36.714 --> 00:00:38.177
&gt;&gt; Please.

00:00:38.177 --> 00:00:39.685
&gt;&gt; I must say two or three things,

00:00:39.685 --> 00:00:43.160
here's my view of things now
that I'm a little older dog.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:47.988
Number one, choose to have kids or
not, but if you choose to have kids

00:00:47.988 --> 00:00:52.510
invest in your kids,
that's to me is the most important thing.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:58.794
Second, go for it, have success,

00:00:58.794 --> 00:01:03.760
but bring others along with you.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:07.683
If I look at my professional success,

00:01:07.683 --> 00:01:15.298
when I was in sales if I shipped
a computer to somebody else's territory.

00:01:15.298 --> 00:01:18.287
I would send an email saying
I think you should get half

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:22.349
versus the managers having to be involved,
I remember it started then.

00:01:24.745 --> 00:01:28.364
If we do something well it's the quiet, so
we will take as many people with you for

00:01:28.364 --> 00:01:29.730
the ride as possible.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:35.589
If you come across a jerk, let them rot
in their misery, just get away from them.

00:01:38.316 --> 00:01:42.060
And number three,
bring it every day, get up,

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.807
I'm telling you there
are some days I go home and

00:01:45.807 --> 00:01:50.290
I am just beat my god,
how much more can I do this?

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.250
A good night's sleep, I get up in
the morning and you bring it again.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:58.969
Fearlessly, just go, go, go,
those are the not the most important,

00:01:58.969 --> 00:02:01.870
but that's how I view through life.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:07.700
And you've heard it before, think of life
when you've got a half hour left to live.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.171
You're not going to think about boy,
my net worth is X,

00:02:10.171 --> 00:02:14.353
it really should have been 1.2X,
I doubt you're going to think about that.

00:02:14.353 --> 00:02:18.473
Boy, I only became CEO or
VP, man I wish I became EVP,

00:02:18.473 --> 00:02:21.670
you're not going to think about that.

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:25.147
Now clearly you have to achieve success
because that's why you're here because

00:02:25.147 --> 00:02:26.530
you're motivated.

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:30.764
And I don't want to short sell that
one bit, but I think in that order,

00:02:30.764 --> 00:02:33.030
take care of the kids, your family.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:38.234
Bring as many people as you can and arrive
with you and get away from the jerks.

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:41.676
And get up in the morning with a good
night's sleep and does bring it.

